  "notes": "{申|もう}し{出|で}る is a compound verb meaning to formally offer or propose something. It has a slightly formal tone.\n\nTRANSITIVITY:\n- Type: {他動詞|たどうし} (transitive)\n- Pattern: Xを{申|もう}し{出|で}る\n\nASPECT (ている):\n- {申|もう}し{出|で}ている means \"has offered / has made a request\" (resulting state)\n\nCOMMON PATTERNS:\n- {協力|きょうりょく}を{申|もう}し{出|で}る: to offer cooperation\n- {退職|たいしょく}を{申|もう}し{出|で}る: to submit a resignation\n\nThe noun form is {申|もう}し{出|で} (an offer; a proposal).",
